0..54 Comment "/// This source states representation independence for"
55..86 Comment "/// structures with operations."
87..90 Comment "///"
91..157 Comment "/// A carrier equivalence moves an operation argument backward and"
158..181 Comment "/// its result forward."
182..257 Comment "/// `Path.funext` compares the carried operation with its target operation."
258..261 Comment "///"
262..334 Comment "/// The examples relate two Boolean toggles and tagged Boolean readings."
335..399 Comment "/// The checker carries each operation through its carrier path."
